{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine, automate and upgrade programs to amass a fortune! Infiniclick is a relaxing incremental game (or not\u2014it's up to you) where your goal is to pay off an unfair debt to\u00a0the\u00a0Fun\u00a0Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each program comes with upgrades that will allow you to earn more money\u00a0with\u00a0them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/gif0.gif?t=1743170371\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some programs will require resources from others\u00a0to\u00a0run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/gif1.gif?t=1743170371\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a bit of creativity, you can even automate parts of\u00a0the\u00a0process!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/gif2.gif?t=1743170371\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612640?t=1743170371","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612640?t=1743170371","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/1620fabaed6c3c91828c3bb5e3e229f4a8ebdd34/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743170371","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/1620fabaed6c3c91828c3bb5e3e229f4a8ebdd34/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743170371","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine, automate and upgrade programs to amass a fortune! Infiniclick is a relaxing incremental game (or not\u2014it's up to you) where your goal is to pay off an unfair debt to\u00a0the\u00a0Fun\u00a0Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each program comes with upgrades that will allow you to earn more money\u00a0with\u00a0them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/gif0.gif?t=1743170371\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some programs will require resources from others\u00a0to\u00a0run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/gif1.gif?t=1743170371\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a bit of creativity, you can even automate parts of\u00a0the\u00a0process!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/extras/gif2.gif?t=1743170371\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Nacho AB"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612640/6ae6833867b49c958a9bea00e253df35b9bf1d45/header.jpg?t=1743170371","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117993,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117993/movie480.mp4?t=1743170369","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117993/movie_max.mp4?t=1743170369"},"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117993/3ea41642f6ccb6508b7735e125a6936cc3bc611c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743170369","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117993/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743170369","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117993/movie_m